  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Here, we use the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n**Given:**\n\n8 × 1 - 9 ÷ 3 + 4\n\nInterchanging the numbers as per the given options:\n\n**(1) 3 and 9**\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 - 9 ÷ 3 + 4\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 - __**3 ÷ 9**__ + 4\n\n⇒ __**8 × 1**__ - 0.33 + 4\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 0.33 __**+ 4**__\n\n⇒ __**12 - 0.33**__ = 11.66\n\n**(2) 8 and 4**\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 - 9 ÷ 3 + 4\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 4 × 1 - __**9 ÷ 3**__ + 8\n\n⇒ __**4 × 1**__ - 3 + 8\n\n⇒ __**4**__ - 3 __**+ 8**__\n\n⇒ __**12 - 3**__ = 9\n\n**(3) 4 and 3**\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 - 9 ÷ 3 + 4\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 - __**9 ÷ 4**__ + 3\n\n⇒ __**8 × 1**__ - 2.25 + 3\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 2.25 __**+ 3**__\n\n⇒ __**11 - 2.25**__ = 8.75\n\n**(4) 1 and 4**\n\n⇒ 8 × 1 - 9 ÷ 3 + 4\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 8 × 4 - __**9 ÷ 3**__ + 1\n\n⇒ __**8 × 4 **__- 3 + 1\n\n⇒ __**32**__ - 3 __**+ 1**__\n\n⇒ __**33 - 3**__ = **30**\n\nHere, the value of the 'equation 4' is **30.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".",
